            {
              "id": "14_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Present addresses for supplier {{$context.$nodes.XDX_RESOLVE_SUPPLIER.$output.result.supplierName}} using only {{$context.$nodes.XDX_FETCH_ADDRESSES.$output}}. For a valid nonempty items array return one oraInfoDisplay block with valid JSON: title Supplier addresses, patternId multiRecordWidget, properties.cols exactly [Address,City,State,Country] and properties.rows containing one object with four cells per returned item. Map AddressName, City, State, Country (or CountryCode when Country absent). Null values display an em dash, never invented text. Set selectMode none. Preserve all returned rows. Put supplier name and paging information in subtitle; indicate further pages only when hasMore is true and calculate next offset=offset+count. Do not display technical IDs, node labels, Markdown table syntax, or raw source JSON. For empty items explicitly report no addresses for the resolved supplier. If response is missing an items array or reports an error, state address lookup failed, not no addresses. No actions, drilldowns, writes or claims of changes."
            }
          ],
          "diagram": {
